keelb: there is no -mtune=native; the CPU is given as -march=<cpu>
usage: keelb <build|test> [options]

options:
      --debug        build with debug information
      --verbose      print the commands that are run
      --cache <dir>  where to store the build cache
  -O<n>              optimisation level, 0 to 3: 2, or 1 under --debug
  -march=<cpu>       the CPU to build for: x86-64-v2 by default, or native
exit 2
